; the canyon's walls: flame tongues (fx/flame.png, tools/bake-flames.mjs: one tongue's life, licking up and pinching
; off its tip) standing on the ground side by side in curtains across each side of the canyon, one behind the other,
; so the tongues read one by one with a white-hot foot; bigger with distance; the far wall burns across the horizon

